# Build artefacts must never enter the build context.
#
# Note that .dockerignore patterns are NOT recursive: `*.tsbuildinfo` matches
# only the context root, so every pattern below needs its `**/` twin. Getting
# this wrong is subtle rather than loud - a stale `.tsbuildinfo` convinces
# `tsc --build` that a project is already up to date, so it skips emitting
# declaration files whose `dist/` directory was correctly excluded, and the
# build fails much later with "cannot find module".
node_modules
**/node_modules

dist
**/dist
dist-client
**/dist-client
dist-tsc
**/dist-tsc

*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

coverage
**/coverage

.git
.github
.env
**/.env
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
